`rewritePathsToPackRoot` uses no resolver state, so behavior is identical today — but if `AgentPackResolver` ever gains per-instance state that matters for rewriting, this silently diverges from the injected test seam. Use the same instance (`packResolver` in `process()` / `_packResolver` here) or make `rewritePathsToPackRoot` static.
